4. **Handle next link**: If a "next" link is present in the Bundle object, create a new HTTP request with the URL specified by the "next" link and repeat steps 1-3 to fetch additional pages of data.
5. **Stop recursion**: Stop recursion when there are no more pagination links (i.e., no "next" or "previous" links).

